--Description:  
-- The earlier error occurred because BigQuery does not recognise the “AT TIME ZONE” clause.  
-- Instead, to view a TIMESTAMP in a specific zone we should:  
--   1) Build the UTC timestamp from micro‑seconds with TIMESTAMP_MICROS().  
